data: {"type":"response.code_interpreter_call_code.done","code":"import math\n# Complex expression:\n# ((sum_{k=1}^{50} (-1)^(k+1) * k^3 / k!) * ln(1+e^pi)\n#   + sqrt(det([[3,1,4],[1,5,9],[2,6,5]])) if positive? det maybe negative\n# Need ensure real. use abs det perhaps.\n# Add integral numerically? Keep pure python.\nM = [[3,1,4],[1,5,9],[2,6,5]]\ndet = (\n    M[0][0]*(M[1][1]*M[2][2]-M[1][2]*M[2][1])\n    - M[0][1]*(M[1][0]*M[2][2]-M[1][2]*M[2][0])\n    + M[0][2]*(M[1][0]*M[2][1]-M[1][1]*M[2][0])\n)\ns = sum(((-1)**(k+1))*k**3/math.factorial(k) for k in range(1,51))\nexpr = (s * math.log1p(math.exp(math.pi)) + math.sqrt(abs(det))) / (math.sin(math.pi/7)**2 + math.cos(math.pi/11)**2) + math.gamma(8)/math.sqrt(2*math.pi)\ndet,s,expr\n","item_id":"ci_08b8e6aa33ebb664016a6cbc71ae4881a189d578869c893d0a","output_index":1,"sequence_number":400}

